The architecture diagram in Figure \ref{fig:system_architecture} illustrates the high-level components of the system and their interactions. The data flow proceeds from top to bottom, beginning with quantum key generation and culminating in the user interface. Key transmission paths include:

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Quantum Key Generation:} The QKD Module generates quantum-secure keys using simulated quantum circuits
    \item \textbf{Secure Encryption:} The Encryption Layer uses these keys to secure payment data with authenticated encryption
    \item \textbf{Neural Network Analysis:} The Fraud Detection Module analyzes the encrypted transaction using advanced pattern recognition
    \item \textbf{Payment Processing:} The verified and secured transaction is processed through the Razorpay API
    \item \textbf{User Feedback:} Results and visualization are presented through the Apple-inspired interface
\end{itemize}

